{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"assumptions\": [\n    \"This revision preserves the prior numerical plan and addresses the review's conditional-alternative finding. Planning is read-only; no files were changed or implementation tests run.\",\n    \"Use existing Python, fractions.Fraction and Z3, recording actual versions during implementation. Exact arithmetic is required by the contract; Z3 remains an implementation choice checked by independent oracles.\",\n    \"Support explicit template registries, finite slots, context-compatible observations and rational-linear mappings. Preserve accepted P03 code, schemas and frozen evidence through a separate versioned adapter/result format.\",\n    \"Requests explicitly supply evidence view, query scope, integer bounds, rounding convention/stage and resource budgets. Unknown conventions remain unresolved; fixture sizes and budgets are engineering choices, not production defaults.\",\n    \"Implementation requires an authorised writable environment and an existing supervisor execution-entry inventory. The recovery record currently supplies no inventory path.\"\n  ],\n  \"checks\": [\n    \"Completed read-only verification: all required P04 deliverables, tests and previously proposed implementation modules remain absent. Read the full structured review and prior plan, including content omitted from recovery excerpts.\",\n    \"Confirmed the review finding against source: P03 emits choice_group=null, retains separate parent constraints, and describes allFixed/allFloating as non-exhaustive conditional views.\",\n    \"Run python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_accounting_p04.py' -v. Require every catalogued obligation to execute without failures, errors, skips, duplicate IDs or missing observations.\",\n    \"Compare complete feasible assignment sets against an independent Fraction enumerator replaying original templates and observations without production lowering or Z3. Perturb identifiers, declaration order, openings, observations, rates, coefficients and slot limits.\",\n    \"Through the actual P03 compiler and P04 adapter, verify alpha=1/2 remains feasible in the parent; allFixed admits only alpha=1 within its query; subsequent parent queries remain unchanged. Add overlapping views alpha<=3/4 and alpha>=1/4: their intersection survives, declaration order preserves feasibility, and view labels neither multiply coverage cells nor create weights. Contradictory view selection makes only that conditional query infeasible.\",\n    \"Check exact debt bounds [5,7]; rounded-case infimum 199/40 attained and supremum 1407/200 unattained; negative ties, half-even parity, posting quantisation, integer gaps, empty strict domains, constant and unbounded objectives. Check feasibility before closed-relaxation bounds.\",\n    \"Test linked choices across accounts/dates, shared observation identity, incompatible marginal extrema, source-labelled conflicts, unresolved obligations, unsupported nonlinear operations, zero-work budgets and interruption after a completed cell. Inject backend Unknown deterministically, avoiding timing-dependent assertions.\",\n    \"Test exact posterior weights 3/11 and 8/11, repeated-information rejection, zero-probability conditioning, unweighted-summary rejection and retained unresolved/default mass. Test all six uncertainty admissions and grouping invalidation after rate, maturity, scenario or horizon changes.\",\n    \"Run python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_accounting_p03.py' -v without regenerating accepted P03 outputs.\",\n    \"Run python3 -B scripts/check_accounting_p04.py --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04 --execution-inventory <existing supervisor inventory>. Resolve the placeholder before execution; require successful checks, matching hashes, complete observations and unchanged protected inputs.\"\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T2