olved cells with a defined counting convention. Enforce slot, formula-size, integer-assignment, cell, solver-resource and elapsed-time limits; retain unvisited regions compactly. Feasible witnesses may coexist with PartialSearch. Infeasible requires all relevant cells proved infeasible; ExactWithinScope additionally requires all applicable obligations resolved or explicitly outside scope. Partial-cell extrema remain explored bounds. Preserve formulas and branch identities, testing joint output tuples against shared constraints.\",\n    \"7. Retain bounded uncertainty, probability and resolution operations. Validate ExtractionReading, HistoricalFact, AccountingElection, MeasurementEstimate, BehaviourPolicy and FutureInnovation against required admission/provenance fields. Separate factual constraints, hypothetical stress and likelihood updates. Finite probabilities require an explicit joint measure on disjoint economic hypotheses; overlapping views are events over that measure, not additional atoms. Preserve unresolved/default mass and reject summaries requiring unavailable outcomes. Permit documented additive grouping only with retained contract memory, matching rate/reset/maturity/hedge keys and checked transition/report preservation for the requested scenario and horizon. Changed requirements force revalidation; approximate or unproved grouping remains unsupported.\",\n    \"8. Implement tests/test_accounting_p04.py and independent oracles using small known-history fixtures plus selected immutable Northstar and borrowing inputs. Independently replay templates to generate observations, withholding hidden histories and authored expected constraints from production reconstruction. Compare complete finite sets and analytic continuous bounds. Include the parent/interior, isolated conditional-query and overlapping-view integration assertions listed in checks; endpoint extrema alone cannot establish preservation of the parent family. Tie every fixture obligation to executed assertions and include metamorphic input changes.\",\n    \"9. Add scripts/check_accounting_p04.py and generate data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04/conformance.json and result.md. Preserve actual input/source/test hashes, generated constraints, witnesses/conflicts, endpoint results, parent/view query identities, partition coverage, oracle comparisons and test outcomes. Include the decision table, strongest alternative explanation, exclusions and unfinished work. Record command, interpreter/package versions, CPU-only execution, deterministic seed status, wall time, reviewed-plan reference, execution inventory and every changed file. Compare protected-file hashes before/after; avoid importing legacy scripts with output-writing side effects. Update progress after meaningful edits and finish checks before the reserved response interval.\"\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"Revised P04 plan preserves P03's parent continuous family and overlapping conditional views. Only genuine finite choices or justified exhaustive partitions create search cells; targeted integration tests detect loss of unnamed interior histories.\",\n  \"verdict\": \"PLAN\"\n}"}}
